### 1. Trigger recipe-import workflow execution
# Triggers the recipe-import workflow with a recipe ID for the 3-step process:
# Extract -> GenerateHero -> SyncRecipe
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workflows/{{recipeImportWorkflowId}}/trigger
Content-Type: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

{
  "parameters": {
    "recipeId": "{{recipeId}}"
  }
}

### 1aa. Trigger url-import workflow execution
# Triggers the url-import workflow for a recipe with a SourceUrl.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workflows/url-import/trigger
Content-Type: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

{
  "parameters": {
    "recipeId": "{{recipeId}}",
    "url": "https://www.ricardocuisine.com/en/recipes/4725-honey-glazed-rack-of-lamb-"
  }
}

### 1ab. Trigger search-reconciliation workflow execution
# Triggers the search-reconciliation workflow for a recipe with a SourceUrl.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workflows/search-reconciliation/trigger
Content-Type: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

{
  "parameters": {
    "recipeId": "{{recipeId}}",
    "url": "https://www.ricardocuisine.com/en/recipes/4725-honey-glazed-rack-of-lamb-"
  }
}

### 1ac. Start vegetarian classification backfill
# Safe initial migration: known rows are skipped. Copy data.instanceId
# from the 202 response into @vegetarianBackfillInstanceId before polling below.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workflows/{{vegetarianBackfillWorkflowId}}/trigger
Content-Type: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

{
  "parameters": {}
}

### 1ad. Get vegetarian backfill instance details
# A batch contains at most 25 recipes and schedules successor batches. Check
# "Get all active workflows" until no vegetarian-classification-backfill remains.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workflows/instances/{{vegetarianBackfillInstanceId}}
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

### 1ae. Get vegetarian classification migration status
# Copy data.instanceId into @vegetarianStatusInstanceId, then poll the request below.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workflows/{{vegetarianStatusWorkflowId}}/trigger
Content-Type: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

{
  "parameters": {}
}

### 1af. Get vegetarian classification status result
# The completed task result reports total/classified/unknown/vegetarian/
# non-vegetarian counts.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workflows/instances/{{vegetarianStatusInstanceId}}
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

### 1ag. Reconcile search after vegetarian backfill settles
# Run once only after no backfill workflow instances remain active.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workflows/search-reconciliation/trigger
Content-Type: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

{
  "parameters": {}
}

### 1a. Trigger recipe-description-regeneration workflow execution
# Regenerates the AI-powered description from the existing recipe.json and finished dish image.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workflows/recipe-description-regeneration/trigger
Content-Type: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

{
  "parameters": {
    "recipeId": "{{recipeId}}"
  }
}

### 1b. Trigger legacy recipe-extraction workflow execution
# Triggers the recipe-extraction workflow with parameters.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workflows/{{workflowId}}/trigger
Content-Type: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

{
  "parameters": {
    "recipeUrl": "{{recipeUrl}}"
  }
}

### 2. Get workflow instance details
# Returns the instance metadata and all associated tasks.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workflows/instances/{{instanceId}}
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

### 3. Get all active workflows
# Returns all Processing or Paused workflow instances.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workflows/active
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

### 4. Reset a failed task
# Resets a failed task to Pending status and updates the workflow to Processing.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workflows/tasks/{{taskId}}/reset
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}
